TITLE 150C water equilibrated with fixed-pressure CH4-CO2-NH3 gas mixture
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    pe 4
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -temperature 150
    -pressure 1
    CH4(g)  0.4  10
    CO2(g)  0.4  10
    NH3(g)  0.2   5
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -totals C N
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uS_per_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
